cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Urban OpenGen, please cite it and credit Differential."
title: "Urban OpenGen: open generative models of urban morphology"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Differential"
    website: "https://differential.studio"
  - family-names: "Klushinsky"
    given-names: "Piotr"
    affiliation: "Differential"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-11"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/differential-studio/urban-opengen"
keywords:
  - urban morphology
  - generative models
  - StyleGAN2-ADA
  - diffusion
  - inpainting
  - OpenStreetMap
abstract: >-
  Generative models of urban morphology trained on 400 m tiles of sixty cities rendered from
  OpenStreetMap: a class-conditional StyleGAN2-ADA with fitted metric directions for
  interactive control, and a conditional diffusion inpainter that fills a drawn region at any
  scale, steered by coverage, floor area ratio, green share, street share, height and grain.
  Code Apache-2.0, inpainter weights CC BY 4.0, data ODbL.
